<dialog aria-labelledby="reading-label" class="reading-dialog" id="reading-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2 id="reading-label">让阅读适合你</h2><button aria-label="关闭阅读设置" class="icon-button close-dialog"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.55" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6"></path></svg></button></div><p class="dialog-description">只调整阅读，不打断内容。</p><fieldset><legend>正文字号</legend><div class="segmented" id="font-size-options"><button aria-pressed="false" data-size="17">小 <span>17</span></button><button aria-pressed="true" data-size="19">标准 <span>19</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" data-size="21">大 <span>21</span></button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>正文字体</legend><div class="segmented" id="font-family-options"><button aria-pressed="true" data-font="sans">黑体 · 清楚</button><button aria-pressed="false" data-font="serif">宋体 · 书页</button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>界面动效</legend><div class="segmented" id="motion-options"><button aria-pressed="true" data-motion-mode="auto" type="button">跟随系统</button><button aria-pressed="false" data-motion-mode="off" type="button">关闭动效</button></div><p class="motion-hint" id="motion-hint">短暂过渡，不循环播放。</p><button class="outline-button motion-replay" id="replay-motion" type="button">↻ 重播页面入场</button></fieldset><div class="font-preview">把页面交给文字，<br/>把时间还给阅读。</div><p class="local-note">偏好仅保存在当前浏览器。</p></dialog>
